---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Licensing | Podomy"
	description="Podomy software is dual-licensed under AGPLv3 for open source use and commercial licenses for proprietary integration."
	currentPath="/licensing/"
>
	<h1 class="page-title">Dual Licensing Model</h1>
	<p class="page-lead">
		Podomy develops core infrastructure under a dual-licensing framework: open-source copyleft licensing (AGPLv3) and commercial enterprise licensing.
	</p>
	<p class="body-p">
		This model ensures our software remains openly accessible to the developer community while providing commercial flexibility, private deployment rights, and direct support to enterprise engineering teams.
	</p>

	<section class="content-section">
		<div class="section-header">
			<h2 class="section-title">License Options</h2>
		</div>
		<ol class="numbered-list">
			<li>
				<div>
					<strong>AGPLv3 (Open Source):</strong> Free for open-source projects, research, and non-commercial evaluation. Grants complete freedom to run, modify, and distribute the software, provided that any derivative works and network services remain open under the same AGPLv3 license terms.
				</div>
			</li>
			<li>
				<div>
					<strong>Commercial License:</strong> Designed for organizations embedding Podomy software into proprietary products, closed-source industrial controllers, or <span class="nowrap">air-gapped</span> fleets without copyleft obligations. Includes commercial warranty, indemnity, and direct engineering support.
				</div>
			</li>
		</ol>
	</section>

	<section class="content-section">
		<div class="section-header">
			<h2 class="section-title">Purchasing & Inquiries</h2>
		</div>
		<p class="body-p">
			To discuss commercial licensing terms and your deployment architecture, email us at <a href="mailto:contact@podomy.com" class="body-link">contact@podomy.com</a>.
		</p>
	</section>
</Layout>
